    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivesmith</strong> is a reverse bullet-hell game with a simple crafting twist. Shoot hails of bullets, missiles, nails, lasers and whatever is at your disposal at your enemies and make tactical choices to overcome all obstacles. You are here to find the '<strong>Life Essence</strong>', and you're not leaving without it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Item Crafting</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has a unique resource (or more) for you to collect. Collect them and craft handy consumable items from your<strong> Survival Kit</strong> to make surviving a little bit easier. But be warned\u2014you\u2019ll need plenty of resources if you hope to face the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Biome Hazards</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has some kind of hazard to throw at you. Make sure you are ready for these random weather changes, unless... you find a way to turn the tides in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Preset Loadouts</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Survivesmith, you don't have to submit to the randomness of the upgrades you get. While there are many random elements to experience in the game, your loadout isn't one of them. Make sure you know what you're doing, and equip well before a round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tactical Skills</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor has multiple tactical skills, ultimate abilities and their primary weapons are all equipped with overcharge abilities. Use the ones that fit your playstyle and survive the oncoming robot hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Level-Up Systems</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character levels up in-run by collecting experience orbs. Choose from Strength, Vitality, Agility and several sub-categories in them to maximize your character's survivability. Perform well in-run to permanently level up your characters, weapons and armor modules to have a better chance at getting to that 'Life Essence'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Helper Gadgets</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring up to 2 gadgets to swap between in-run to aid you with tedious tasks like finding resources, collecting resources, or to heal yourself or simply have extra fire-support! Level them up alongside you and maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You control your weapons</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single special weapon (the extra weapons apart from the primary weapon) has a secret for you to discover. While some of them are obvious enough, some may require careful attention. Use this to control how your weapons behave and not let them always have a mind of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Combo meter</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep firing and destroying those bots to keep the fire up! Magic will start happening if you keep the meter going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and unleash absolute firepower in <i>Survivesmith</i>. Discover hidden weapon secrets, master your loadout, and forge your own path to the ultimate prize\u2014the Life Essence. Do you have what it takes to outlast the human-made machine hordes and the unforgiving nature to save humanity?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivesmith</strong> is a reverse bullet-hell game with a simple crafting twist. Shoot hails of bullets, missiles, nails, lasers and whatever is at your disposal at your enemies and make tactical choices to overcome all obstacles. You are here to find the '<strong>Life Essence</strong>', and you're not leaving without it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Item Crafting</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has a unique resource (or more) for you to collect. Collect them and craft handy consumable items from your<strong> Survival Kit</strong> to make surviving a little bit easier. But be warned\u2014you\u2019ll need plenty of resources if you hope to face the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Biome Hazards</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has some kind of hazard to throw at you. Make sure you are ready for these random weather changes, unless... you find a way to turn the tides in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/a97034194602a6446536ee2609c531ba.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Preset Loadouts</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Survivesmith, you don't have to submit to the randomness of the upgrades you get. While there are many random elements to experience in the game, your loadout isn't one of them. Make sure you know what you're doing, and equip well before a round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/e35a8777b0c352346bfed8c548298a66.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tactical Skills</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor has multiple tactical skills, ultimate abilities and their primary weapons are all equipped with overcharge abilities. Use the ones that fit your playstyle and survive the oncoming robot hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/cf7f3a26313a94928a7774557a5f99f4.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Level-Up Systems</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character levels up in-run by collecting experience orbs. Choose from Strength, Vitality, Agility and several sub-categories in them to maximize your character's survivability. Perform well in-run to permanently level up your characters, weapons and armor modules to have a better chance at getting to that 'Life Essence'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/7479ac0f7c4be511467134b23316a217.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Helper Gadgets</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring up to 2 gadgets to swap between in-run to aid you with tedious tasks like finding resources, collecting resources, or to heal yourself or simply have extra fire-support! Level them up alongside you and maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You control your weapons</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single special weapon (the extra weapons apart from the primary weapon) has a secret for you to discover. While some of them are obvious enough, some may require careful attention. Use this to control how your weapons behave and not let them always have a mind of their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Combo meter</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep firing and destroying those bots to keep the fire up! Magic will start happening if you keep the meter going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.poster.avif?t=1748491224\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.webm?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/11f438f441f2aa967a52f136b44f1ff5.mp4?t=1748491224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and unleash absolute firepower in <i>Survivesmith</i>. Discover hidden weapon secrets, master your loadout, and forge your own path to the ultimate prize\u2014the Life Essence. Do you have what it takes to outlast the human-made machine hordes and the unforgiving nature to save humanity?</p>",
